{title: This I Believe (The Creed)}
{artist: Hillsong Worship}
{key: C}
{tempo: 71}

{comment: Intro}
[F]  [Am]  [G]  [C/E]
[F]  [Am]  [G]  [C/E]

{comment: Verse 1}
[F]Our Father [Am]everlasting
[G]The all [C/E]creating [F]One
God [G]almighty [C/E]

[F]Through Your Holy [Am]Spirit
[G]Conceiving Christ [C/E]the [F]Son
Jesus our [G]Savior

{comment: Chorus}
[C]I believe in God our [Dm]Father
[F]I believe in Christ the [G]Son
[Am]I believe in the Holy Spirit
[F]Our God is three in [C]one
I believe in the [Dm]resurrection
[F]That we will rise [G]again
[Am]For I believe in the [F]name of [G]Jesus

{comment: Verse 2}
[F]Our Judge and our [Am]Defender
[G]Suffered and [C/E]crucified
[F]Forgiveness is [Em]in [G]You [C/E]

[F]Descended into [Am]darkness
[G]You rose in [C/E]glorious [F]life
Forever seated [G]high

{comment: Bridge}
I [F]beli[Am]eve in [G]You  [C/E]
I [F]believe You [Am]rose [G]again  [C/E]
I [F]believe that [G]Jesus Christ is [C]Lord

{comment: Chorus 2}
[C]I believe in life [Dm]eternal
[F]I believe in the virgin [G]birth
[Am]I believe in the saints' communion
[F]And in Your holy [C]church
I believe in the [Dm]resurrection
[F]When Jesus comes [G]again
[Am]For I believe in the [F]name of [G]Jesus [C]

{comment: Ending}
[Am]For I believe in the [F]name of [G]Jesus [C]
